    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Superseded by already-merged PR #303 at `69a1137c6ab4ede2a0d1e420cde477f29b0b2949`.\n\nFresh authority review confirms #303 implements the same selected Stage 7.13 contract with a narrower twelve-file scope: branch-aware `win|lose|interrupted` target-NPC DM reply after aftermath acknowledgement, wrong-NPC non-consumption, legacy Stage 7.12 migration, exactly-once delivery, reopen/refresh no-duplicate behavior, ordinary-DM isolation, and current Stage 7 regression coverage.\n\nThis PR must not be merged on top of #303 because it is a parallel duplicate with overlapping controller/index changes. The independent implementation run `31103749482` remains useful forensic evidence and caught a stale-reference persistence failure in its own alternate design, but the merged #303 harness already verifies persisted `delivered` state through reopen and destroy/resume.\n\nClosing without merge. No content from this branch is required on current `main`.",
